  "title": "Cosmos Health Appoints Big 4 Accounting Firm KPMG as Auditor",
  "summary": "CHICAGO, IL / ACCESSWIRE / August 8, 2023 / Cosmos Health Inc. (\"Cosmos Health\" or the \"Company'') (NASDAQ:COSM), a global healthcare group with proprietary lines of nutraceuticals and distributor of pharmaceuticals, branded generics, OTC medications and medical devices, announced today the engagement of KPMG Certified Auditors S.A. (\"KPMG\") as the Company's independent registered public accounting firm, effective August 7, 2023. KPMG replaces the Company's former auditor, Armanino LLP. The appo",
